+	 * This panel only supports DSC; unconditionally enable it.
+	 *
+	 * Keep the proven configuration: the DSI host computes the rate
+	 * control parameters (spec tables) so that the PPS packet sent to the
+	 * panel, the 0x9e payload and the DPU encoder all stay in sync.  Do
+	 * NOT switch to the stock OPLUS RC tables here: with them the panel
+	 * garbles whenever frames are committed back to back.  One slice per
+	 * packet (the upstream default) is likewise required -- the stock
+	 * "2 slices in one packet" framing shows regularly spaced horizontal
+	 * line artifacts.
+	 */
